Let Questions be France, Japan, Kenya, Canada, Brazil.
Let Answers be Paris, Tokyo, Nairobi, Ottawa, Brasilia.
Let score be 0.
For each country in Questions:
    Ask "What is capital of " country "?" and call the answer answer.
    If answer is right answer of country, say "Right" and set score to score plus 1.
    If answer is not right answer of country, say "Wrong. Right answer is " right answer of country.
Say "Your score is " score " from 5".
If score is 4 or more, say "Well done!".
